Subject: [PATCH] flourite: enumerate vendor camera keys outside HyperOS

CameraCapabilities uses the same key-name set for static characteristics and
capture requests. Its non-HyperOS path only enumerates request keys, discarding
stock beauty JSON/version, video configurations and RAW capabilities even when
the HAL publishes them. Keep the stock getAllVendorKeys path for this app on
Lineage too; do not spoof HyperOS globally or force individual capabilities.

Target: flourite Camera 6.4.000320.1 (OS3.0.304.0.WPRMIXM).

diff --git a/smali_classes2/Z5/d.smali b/smali_classes2/Z5/d.smali
--- a/smali_classes2/Z5/d.smali
+++ b/smali_classes2/Z5/d.smali
@@ -1950,12 +1950,6 @@
 
     iput-object p2, p0, LZ5/d;->f:Ljava/util/HashSet;
 
-    invoke-static {}, LHh/c;->i()Z
-
-    move-result p2
-
-    if-eqz p2, :cond_1
-
     sget-object p2, Luc/a;->a:Landroid/hardware/camera2/CameraCharacteristics$Key;
 
     invoke-virtual {p1}, Landroid/hardware/camera2/CameraCharacteristics;->getNativeCopy()Landroid/hardware/camera2/impl/CameraMetadataNative;
